.SH "نام (NAME)"
ssh-tpm-hostkeys \- ssh\-tpm\-agent hostkey utility
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.sp
\fBssh\-tpm\-hostkeys\fP
.sp
\fBssh\-tpm\-hostkeys\fP \fB\-\-install\-system\-units\fP
.sp
\fBssh\-tpm\-hostkeys\fP \fB\-\-install\-sshd\-config\fP
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
\fBssh\-tpm\-hostkeys\fP displays the system host keys, and can install relevant
systemd units and sshd configuration to use TPM backed host keys.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.sp
\fB\-\-install\-system\-units\fP
.RS 4
Installs systemd system units for using ssh\-tpm\-agent as a hostkey agent.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-\-install\-sshd\-config\fP
.RS 4
Installs sshd configuration for the ssh\-tpm\-agent socket.
.RE
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.sp
\fBssh\-tpm\-agent\fP(1), \fBssh\-agent\fP(1)